              <p class="iq-quote">"{ex.low}"</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <p>The chart below applies this to the concept-appeal themes: it plots how often each appeared (horizontal) against its mean intensity, scored with a method called Best-Worst Scaling and labeled BWS on the vertical axis. Themes in the upper-right are both frequent and heavily weighted.</p>
