    <div class="insight">
      <p><strong>Applying AI to your own job is both the most frequent and the most heavily weighted appeal driver.</strong> Own-job application and the no-coding signal sit in the frequent-and-weighty quadrant. Role-relevance confirmation and "systematic AI use" appear often but carry lower weight, which is consistent with participants treating relevance as table stakes and hands-on application as the real draw.</p>
